  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "The external lighting shall be installed in accordance with the details and lighting plan contained in the Lighting\r\nDesign Specification Report reference :LS 4065191-A by Abacus Lighting Limited .",
    "The MUGA pitch and sports pitch shall only used between the hours of 08:30 and 18:00 (Monday to Friday) and shall not be used at any time outside of these hours for any purpose.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Existing and Proposed MUGA (B) Front, Rear and Side Elevations (drawing no: 3580/02/PD09, dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed MUGA (A) Front, Rear and Side Elevations (drawing no: 3580/02/PD08, dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed MUGA (B) Plan (drawing no: 3580/02/PD06, dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed MUGA (A) Plan (drawing no: 3580/02/PD05, dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Site Plan (drawing no: 3580/02/PD02, dated: November 2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location Plan (drawing no: 3580/02/PD01, dated: November 2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Illuminace Levels Plans and Specification Details (dated: 24/07/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design and Access Statement (December 2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;"
